> constructors are named `<init>`

I think that for bytebuddy the name that matches a constructor is actually an empty string.
`NameMatcher` uses `atcher.matches(target.getActualName());` 
`MethodDescription` has
```
        public String getActualName() {
            return isMethod()
                    ? getName()
                    : EMPTY_NAME;
        } 
```
didn't test
